                 <lb n="9"/>kīrtiy-aṁka-siṁhaṁ śruta <supplied reason="lost" evidence="previouseditor">tala-bhūpa</supplied> bhayavalu bhūsiradā <gap reason="illegible" unit="character" quantity="2"/>
