                  <lb n="76" break="no"/>lam akku kādharmma mēlādanvuke bājanaru Ā vāraṇāsiya
                  <lb n="77" break="no"/>lu sāyira kavileyaṁ sāyira bhrāhmaṇarddaṁ <choice><unclear>kā</unclear><unclear>sā</unclear></choice>la
                  <lb n="78" break="no"/>mmaṁ <supplied reason="lost" evidence="previouseditor">kōnda</supplied> pāpaman eydaru <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g>
                  
              </p>

             
